Package: monteriskr
Title: Bayesian Demand Modeling and Monte Carlo Risk Analysis for Events
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aryaan", "Swain", email = "aryaanswain@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Bayesian negative binomial demand models with capacity 
    censoring using brms, simulates posterior predictive demand, and 
    computes Monte Carlo risk metrics for event planning scenarios.
